# Secrets — never commit these. `.env` alone would miss .env.production and friends.
.env*
# These two hold only the API URL the build points at — no secrets, and they are in the repo.
# Scoped to frontend/ on purpose: a backend .env.production would hold the real credentials.
!frontend/.env.development
!frontend/.env.production
*.env
!local.env.example
.secret_key
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

